## 附加说明 / Additional note

本仓库**不包含**任何游戏的原始资源或反编译产物。
`BepInEx/interop`、`unity-libs` 以及游戏的 dll 均为本地依赖，使用者需自行从已购买的游戏与
相应开源工具（BepInEx、Il2CppInterop）获得。

This repository contains **no** game assets or decompiled game code.
`BepInEx/interop`, `unity-libs` and the game assemblies are local dependencies
that users must obtain from their own purchased copy of the game and from the
corresponding open-source tools (BepInEx, Il2CppInterop).
